WOW-BG3 benilla patch 0008: WoW's chat typed from the BG3 window (on top of 0001-0007).

- wowbg3_keys.rs (new): reads $WOW_BG3_LINK_DIR/bg3keys.bin (BGK1, written by the BG3 mod's
  WowChat.lua) and plays its key records as benilla's own keyboard (KeyboardInput before bevy's
  input systems: physical key, key-up of every key-down played, US-layout character from the SDL
  scancode and Shift/Caps), one record a frame; records above the last played, oldest first, the
  file's history skipped at startup. Guard: after a session's first key (Enter or /, which open
  WoW's chat box through its own bindings) the rest plays only while a visible WoW edit box holds
  the keyboard; none within 0.5 s, or focus lost, drops the rest of the session (key-ups of keys
  already played still go). Writes bg3keys-reader.txt at startup in world mode, the mod's
  go-ahead for typing sessions.
- lib.rs, wowbg3.rs: module and plugin registration.

